# L §3.2 (round 12): a bare literal at `*` "takes each key's unit": amt2[*] = 5 is 5 PLN at PLN and 5 EUR at EUR.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-18
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
input amt2[c in currencies]: num c

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt2[*] = 5

ask q: amt2[PLN], amt2[EUR]
=== expect
q: (5 PLN, 5 EUR)
  cut 2026-10-18
